  "reference": "Shītwa Sha Batūng'Wa 15",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibanza lya kanisa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo kūhayimanīla banhū balebe batulumenha bizile kūfuma Būyudaya, aho bashika ī Antiokia būyūbalanga a badūgū gīkī, “Ūlū mutasaalilwe gīt'ūmo shilī shīmīle īsho tūlangilwe na Musa, mutūdūla ū kūpījiwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūbūūka yombo na wihalalīja būtaale, gwike a ba Paulo nū Balinaba bīmīīla hīgīyī kwishokeja nabo a banhū benabo; nose yūbonwa gīkī hambū hambū ū Paulo nū Balinaba batūng'we hamò na bangī, balinhe kūja ī Yelusalemu ū kū batūng'wa na a banamhala, kūlwa nguno ya halalī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balagwa nī kanisa, būbītīla Foenike na Samalia, būja bakwīsomboolaga mu welwa ng'holò pyī ī mihayo ya kūgalūka kwa banhū ba mahanga; pye a badūgū bakayega no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika ī Yelusalemu, begelejiwa nī kanisa hamò na a batūng'wa, na a banamhala; būbasomboolela īyo Mulungu wabeejaga hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bīmīīla Bafalisayo, abo baalī bakwanukūla ū kūzunya; bandya kūhaya gīkī, “A banhū ba mahanga shiigelile bayūsaalwa na kūkomelejiwa kūshidima ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūng'wa na a banamhala bibilinga kūgūlola ū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyūbīta ikanza balīgūhoyela, hūna wīmīīla ū Petelo ūbawīla gīkī, “Bababa badūgū bane, a bing'we benekīlī mumanile ūmo Mulungu akasolela makanza malebe; yabizaga ka kale ho, gīkī a banhū ba mahanga bagwigwe ū mhayo gwa Ng'hūlū Jawiza kūfuma kūlī nene, bazunye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mulungu ūyo ayīmanile ī myoyo, ūbakaanīla mu kūbinha Moyo Ng'wela gīt'ūmo akatwinhīla a bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bazunya atasolanije a ha gatī yise na a boi ū mu kūjeeja īng'holò jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nibūlī lūūlū ī haha mulīngema ū Mulungu, mu nzīla ya kūbatūūlīla ijoki idito mu nhingo a bahemba, īlo tūlīlemeelilwe a bise ū kūlībūūcha, pye na a bakūlūgenji bise baalī balīlemeelilwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bise tūzunije gīkī, tūlī bapījiwa kūlwa shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba Yesu, gīt'ūmo īlī nū kū bene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna pyī ī libanza lyūhuumūlīja sele kūbadegeleka a ba Balinaba nū Paulo; nguno bakandya kūsomboola ūmo Mulungu wabeejaga shimanīkījo na mihayo ya kūkumya ū kū banhū ba mahanga kūbītīla mubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamala, ū Yakobo ūshosha alīhaya gīkī, “Bing'we bababa, nidegelekagi badūgū bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Simioni watūsomboolela gīt'ūmo kūfuma kale ū Mulungu abizūkīlile a banhū ba mahanga, hama nīyo wamala kwisolela banhū kūlwa lina lyakwe kūfuma ū mubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwenūyū gwideebelile nū mhayo gwa bahangi ūmo gwandīkīlilwe; gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ali lūūlū, ū būlamuji bone būlī gīkī, tūtizūbazwanja a banhū ba mahanga abo bakūngalūkīlaga Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo tūbandīkīlagi gīkī bikomanye nabo ū būsoso bo kwitongeleja kū mashiikolile, nū būjingi; hama yaya nūūlū kūlya ndimu ja kūnigwa, na a mininga yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno kūfuma shibyalīlwe sha kale na kale, ū Musa alī na bahemba bakwe hose hose ū mu mizengo; būlī sabato akasomagwa ū mu masinagogi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlamuji w'ibanza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūkabayeja a batūng'wa na a banamhala, nī kanisa ī yose, gwa kūbasola banhū kūfuma mubo, gīkī babatūme baje ī Antiokia hamò nū Paulo nū Balinaba. Ūsolwa Yuda, ūyo witanagwa Balisaba na Sila, bamò ba banhū bataale ū ng'wigele lya badūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbinha na nyalūba ya kūja nayo; īhayile gīkī, “Bise badūgū bing'we batūng'wa, hamò na banamhala: Kū badūgū bise a ba mahanga, abo balī Antiokia na Sulia, na Kilikia. Tūlīmugīsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twigwile gīkī bamò ba mu bise baashikile kwenūko, būmukoya na mihayo ya kūmuzwanja maganiko; tūtabatūmile bise a benabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, a bise ū kūūnū tūlī n'iganiko līmò, twabonile īlī yawiza kūsola banhū tūbatūme bize ūko mulī, hamò na a batogwa bise, a ba Balinaba nū Paulo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "banhū abo bifunya būpanga wabo kūlwa lina lya ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babo kwenūko lūūlū ba Yuda na Sila, twabatūmaga bize ko hamò nabo; bakūmuwīla ī mihayo yenīyī gīt'ūmo īlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno yabelelile ū kūlī Moyo Ng'wela hamò nū kū bise gīkī, ītīho nguno ya kūmuseseja nigo gūngī gose gose, ūlū ītī mihayo īyī gīkī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūlya ī shitambo sha mu mawitongeleja, na a mininga, pyī nī ndimu ja kūnigwa; yaya nūūlū kwisanja mu mihayo ya būjingi. Ūlū ng'ūlekana nayo ī yenīyo, mukūtūngīlīja. Ikalagi mu mhola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho balagwa, būja būūkashika ī Antiokia; aho balīkuminga pyī ī libita, būbinha ī nyalūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahayūmala ū kūsong'wa bakayega no, hangī būlūngūjiwa nū būkomelejiwa wenūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda nū Sila būbatimbyang'holò na kūbaguzuhya a badūgū; nguno nabo baalī bahangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bikala nabo ikanza lya shikū ningī ho hado, būlagwa bashoke mhola ū kū badūgū abo baalī babatūma. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Sila ūtogwa kwikala nabo ū ng'wene.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a ba Paulo nū Balinaba būlenda ī Antiokia, būdimana na bangī bingī mu nīmo gwa kūlanga na kūgūlomeela ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wilemeelwa bo ng'wa Paulo na Balinaba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta shikū ndebe ū Paulo ūng'wīla ū Balinaba gīkī, “Tūshokage ko hangī tūje tūbageniha a badūgū ū mu mizengo ī yose, ūko twagūlomeelile ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba; tūje tūbalola ūmo balījīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balinaba ūbona ībeelelile banjane nū Yohana, ūyo witanagwa Maliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Paulo ūbona īkūbeelela ūlū kūleka kūnsola ū munhū ng'wenūyo, nguno aho balī Pamfulia akabaleka, winogolelwa ū kūja nabo ū kū nīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yū, nīyo būbiza ho wizwanja būtaale; kūshisha nose būlekana. Ū Balinaba ūnsola ū Maliko ūja nang'hwe Kupulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Paulo ū ng'wene ūnsola Sila; aho bamala kūlombelwa shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba na a badūgū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbūūka ajile. Ūbīta mu Sulia na Kilikia, ūja akūjiguzuhyaga ī kanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
